// WHAT: compose part -- writing practice with AI feedback: tasks generated by mode (translate, use given
//       expressions, describe, free), grading (pass, minor-slip pass, retry) with corrections, examples and a
//       local diff, revise-and-resubmit
//       in one session, a revise queue, history with error stats, and expressions captured into the
//       notebook dictionary.
// DEPS: web/src/ai/client, web/src/storage/port, web/src/ui/tabs, ../notebook (store, model), ./model, ./store,
//       ./practice, ./lists.
// INPUT: ComposeProps (specs/web-compose.md §4). All wording through labels / tasks / grader / categories.
// EVENTS: task + attempt records in collection "compose"; captured terms in "terms".
// AI: optional -- without it tasks cannot be generated, free writing and saved tasks still work (self-judged).
// CONSTRAINTS: subject-agnostic, secrets-gated, state-backed; three verdicts, partial counts as a pass (W-2).
// DEMO: mountCompose(el, {storage: memory, aiClient: null, tasks:{system:""}, grader:{system:""}}).

